            {
                "commitId": "1bbd6a79622e8aee87ca5d2c9b191739699ee0ec",
                "prId": "8662",
                "author": "Vick Wang",
                "message": "Handle non-retryable errors in TopicsSubscriber (#8662)\n\nWhen performTopicOperation() throws a non-retryable IOException (such as\nHTTP 400 Bad Request), syncTopics() previously aborted without removing\nthe failed operation from TopicsStore or completing its pending\nTaskCompletionSource. This caused the caller's Task<Void> to hang\nindefinitely and blocked all subsequent topic operations in the\npersistent queue.\n\n- Catch non-retryable IOExceptions per operation in syncTopics(), remove\nthe failed operation from TopicsStore, fail the corresponding\nTaskCompletionSource with the exception, and continue syncing remaining\nqueued operations.\n\n- Add unit tests in TopicsSubscriberRoboTest covering non-retryable\nsubscribe/unsubscribe failures and multi-operation queue progression.\n\nFixes https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/issues/8620",
                "commitLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/commit/1bbd6a79622e8aee87ca5d2c9b191739699ee0ec",
                "prLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/pull/8662"
            },
            {
                "commitId": "e51192421f7e05225acd3a568bd30f1e06b8e69d",
                "prId": "8658",
                "author": "Vick Wang",
                "message": "URL-encode topic name in TopicSubscriptionClient (#8658)\n\nURL-encode the topic name in TopicSubscriptionClient when constructing\nthe topicSubscriptions URL path.\n\n- Use Uri.encode(topic) so percent characters (%) in valid topic names\nare encoded as %25 while preserving RFC 3986 unreserved characters (-,\n_, ., ~).\n\n- Add unit tests in TopicSubscriptionClientRoboTest covering URL\nencoding for subscribe and unsubscribe requests.\n\nFixes https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/issues/8620",
                "commitLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/commit/e51192421f7e05225acd3a568bd30f1e06b8e69d",
                "prLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/pull/8658"
            }
        ],
