                "commitId": "61d7ea4717667f5da0dd662008ac7c1699081124",
                "prId": "8675",
                "author": "Rodrigo Lazo",
                "message": "[AI] Fix AI Logic changelog (#8675)\n\nUpdate `ai-logic/firebase-ai/CHANGELOG.md` to reflect the latest change\nin `GenerativeBackend`",
                "commitLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/commit/61d7ea4717667f5da0dd662008ac7c1699081124",
