            {
                "commitId": "1df4021f956c6c042ebbf68b0765fc9dfcca6030",
                "prId": "8674",
                "author": "Rodrigo Lazo",
                "message": "[AI] Address rebranding changes (#8674)\n\nReverts changes introduced in PR #8640",
                "commitLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/commit/1df4021f956c6c042ebbf68b0765fc9dfcca6030",
                "prLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/pull/8674"
            },
            {
                "commitId": "46ae3a2e547a09f49507550f532a10a1e81d5a61",
                "prId": "8663",
                "author": "Vinay Guthal",
                "message": "Add support for system instructions in the ondevice sdk. (#8663)\n\nAdds support for `systemInstruction` when generating content using\non-device and hybrid inference modes.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **`firebase-ai-ondevice-interop`**: Added an optional\n`systemInstruction: TextPart?` property to `GenerateContentRequest` and\nupdated `api.txt`.\n- **`firebase-ai-ondevice`**: Updated `GenerateContentRequest.toMlKit()`\nin `Converters.kt` to convert the interop `TextPart` into an ML Kit\n`SystemInstruction`.\n- **`firebase-ai`**:\n- Passed `systemInstruction` from `GenerativeModel.Builder` to\n`OnDeviceGenerativeModelProvider`.\n- Updated `OnDeviceGenerativeModelProvider` to validate that\n`systemInstruction` contains only text parts (throwing\n`FirebaseAIOnDeviceInvalidRequestException` for non-text parts),\nconcatenate multiple `TextPart` instances with a newline, and attach it\nto the on-device request.\n- **Tests & Changelogs**: Added unit tests in `ConvertersTest`,\n`GenerativeModelBuilderTests`, and\n`OnDeviceGenerativeModelProviderTests`, and updated `CHANGELOG.md`\nacross all three modules.\n\n\nTested updating the quickstart app to add testing functionality for\nsystem instruction at\nhttps://github.com/firebase/quickstart-android/pull/2846",
                "commitLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/commit/46ae3a2e547a09f49507550f532a10a1e81d5a61",
                "prLink": "https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk/pull/8663"
            }
        ],
